  "content": {
    "title": "吉林省2023年国有企业定向招聘高校毕业生（第一批）的公告",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2023-07-20",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <p style=\"margin-left:7px; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:方正小标宋简体\">吉林省</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">2023</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:方正小标宋简体\">年国有企业定向招聘</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:7px; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:方正小标宋简体\">高校毕业生（第一批）的公告</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:black\">为深入贯彻党的二十大精神，落实中央及省委人才工作会议精神，切实落实《人力资源社会保障部关于开展</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">2023</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:black\">年高校毕业生等青年就业创业推进计划的通知》（人社部函〔</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">2023</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:black\">〕</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">19</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:black\">号）要求，积极促进我省</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">2023</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:black\">年应届高校毕业生留吉就业，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">吉林省人社厅会同省委宣传部、省财政厅、省国资委、省教育厅开展吉林省</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">2023</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">年国有企业定向招聘高校毕业生的工作，现公告如下：</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">一、招聘对象</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">本次定向招聘对象为吉林省内高校</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">2023</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">年应届毕业生（含择业期内未落实工作单位的高校毕业生）。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">二、招聘人数</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:black\">吉林省省属及以下国有企业</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">计划招聘</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">469</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">人（具体岗位信息及相关要求详见《吉林省</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">2023</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">年国有企业定向招聘高校毕业生岗位信息表》）。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">三、应聘条件</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">具有中华人民共和国国籍；</span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">遵守中华人民共和国宪法、法律、法规；</span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">具有良好的品行；</span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">具备履行岗位职责所需的身体条件和心理素质；</span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">符合所报岗位规定的学历、专业要求及其他资格条件。</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">招聘程序</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:53px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:楷体_GB2312\">（一）报名与资格审查</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">报名时间自</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">2023</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">7</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">24</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">日</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">9</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">时起至</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">2023</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">7</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">28</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">日</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">17</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">时止。本次定向招聘采取网上报名，应聘人员登录</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">“</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">吉林人才网</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">”</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">（</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">https://www.jlrc.com.cn/</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">）从“吉林省</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">2023</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">年国有企业定向招聘高校毕业生报名专区”进入报名系统，选择相应企业进行报名，所填信息及简历要与本人实际情况相符。招聘企业应在规定时限内对照招聘岗位条件要求，对应聘人员进行资格审查。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:楷体_GB2312\">考试、面试、体检、考察和公示等事宜</span></span></strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">各地指导所属国有企业根据招聘需要，结合工作实际采取适当形式，组织开展考试、面试、体检、考察和公示等事宜，并于</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">月底前完成招聘工作。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:楷体_GB2312\">聘用</span></span></strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">9</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">日前，招聘企业与拟聘用人员签订劳动合同，履行聘用手续，组织到岗工作。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">注意事项</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">应聘人员需仔细审阅岗位信息及招聘条件，认真填写报名信息，确保所填信息真实无误，且本人情况满足应聘岗位条件要求。</span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">应聘人员确保所留手机号码保持畅通，方便招聘企业联系沟通，及时获取招聘信息。</span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">招聘信息在吉林省人社厅网站（</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">http://hrss.jl.gov.cn/</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">）、</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">“96885</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">吉人在线</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">”</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">（</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">https://96885.hrss.jl.gov.cn/</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">）、吉林省国资委网站（</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">http://gzw.jl.gov.cn/</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">）、吉林省高等学校毕业生就业信息网（</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">http://www.jilinjobs.cn/</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">）、吉林人才网（</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">https://www.jlrc.com.cn/</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">）、中国吉林网（</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">http://www.cnjiwang.com/</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">）、吉林出版集团股份有限公司官网（</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">http://www.jlpg.cn/</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">）等网站公开发布。</span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">应聘人员如有疑问，可直接与招聘企业联系（联系方式详见附件）。所有招聘工作有关事宜均以招聘企业答复内容为准。网上报名技术咨询电话：</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">0431-82537679</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">。</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:107px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><a href=\"https://zhjy.jilinjobs.cn:8080/group1/cms/t_biz_attachment/content2/2023-07-20/d71d5e80-2e32-4f22-b374-ca6d33c6579e.xlsx\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">附件：吉林省</span>2023<span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">年国有企业定向招聘高校毕业生岗位信息表</span></a></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:363px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;吉林省人力资源和社会保障厅</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:black\">中共吉林省委宣传部</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:384px; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;吉林省财政厅</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:black\">吉林省人民政府国有资产</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 监督管理委员会&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:black\">吉林省教育厅</span></span></span>&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2023</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:black\">年</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">7</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:black\">月</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot